Yes, exactly. I understand the distinction now.

The **first 6 slides should be a normal professional client presentation** — diagrams, architecture, business flow, and animation. They should **not look like mobile app screens**.

Only **Slides 7 and 8** should transition into the actual mobile product and demonstrate the CEO journey.

Here is the corrected 8-slide structure:

