# Slide 4 — How the Workflow Engine Works

### **From a Business Event to an Executive Decision**

This is a **normal workflow diagram**, not a UI.

Example:

```text
Business Event
Revenue drops below target
        ↓
Workflow Trigger
        ↓
Call Sales API
        ↓
Retrieve Opportunities
        ↓
Check Business Condition
Revenue risk > ₹50L?
        ↓
       YES
        ↓
Send relevant data to LLM
        ↓
Generate Executive Insight
        ↓
CEO Attention Required
```

Beside the diagram, explain simply:

> **The workflow engine acts like a set of instructions. It determines what information to retrieve, what conditions to check and what should happen next.**

### Animation

Each node activates sequentially.

This helps non-technical people understand **what “workflow” means**.

